SecChat packages and integrates Mattermost (https://mattermost.com), Team Edition, as the
suite's team-chat and chat-ops surface — wired to SecSSO for single sign-on and to SecAgent
through the @whonixnetworks/pi-mattermost bridge. Mattermost is a third-party project under
its own license; it is not included in this repository — its container images are pulled at
deploy time.
